ogTitle: GullStack — AI-Powered Marketing for Small Business
ogDescription: Custom websites, SEO, AEO, AI consulting, and business automation for small businesses. One partner. Real results.
css: |
  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     HOMEPAGE HERO
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .hero {
    min-height: 70vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 140px 24px 80px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background: url('/images/salt-lake-hero.jpg') center center / cover no-repeat;
